# At read committed every statement takes its own snapshot, so a response built
# from two of them can be built from two different ledgers.

title: a read runs at the level it inherits instead of repeatable read
file: internal/ledgerhttp/ledgerhttp.go
run: go test -count=1 -run TestPoolLendsAReadAtRepeatableRead -v ./internal/ledgerhttp/
--- before
		Isolation: sql.LevelRepeatableRead,
--- after
		Isolation: sql.LevelDefault,
